#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "56_Mei Hua"
msgid "Oh! Ma-chan..."
msgstr "Oh! Ma-chan..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68_Tanimura"
msgid "I got here as quick as I could. What's going on? I've never\\r\nheard you sound so worried over the phone before."
msgstr "Vine lo mas rápido que pude, ¿Qué ocurrió? Jamás te había escuchado\\r\ntan preocupada por el teléfono antes."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Mei Hua"
msgid "The Asian Gateway money's gone missing."
msgstr "El dinero de Puerta Asiática desapareció."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92_Tanimura"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "¡¿Qué?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "104_Zhao"
msgid "\"Gone missing\"? I think you meant we got flat-out robbed.\\r\nOww..."
msgstr "\"¿Desapareció?\" Creo que quieres decir que lo robaron.\\r\nOww..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "116_Mei Hua"
msgid "Are you okay, Dad?"
msgstr "¿Estás bien, papá?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "128_Tanimura"
msgid "Yeah, Zhao-san, what happened?"
msgstr "Eso, Zhao-san, ¿qué pasó?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "140_Zhao"
msgid "These guys suddenly barged in here and said, \"Give us the money you're hoarding.\" I tried to say no..."
msgstr "Unos tipos llegaron y dijeron: \"Denos todo el dinero que tienen\".\\r\nIntenté decirles que no..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "152_Mei Hua"
msgid "...And that's why I look like this."
msgstr "...Y por eso me veo así."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "164_Tanimura"
msgid "They raided the place in broad daylight, huh...\\r\nDo you have any injuries? How about Mei Hua?"
msgstr "Robaron a plena luz del dia, ugh...\\r\n¿Te lastimaron? ¿Y a Mei Hua?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176_Zhao"
msgid "I'm fine. And Mei Hua wasn't here."
msgstr "Estoy bien. Y Mei Hua no estaba."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "188_Tanimura"
msgid "That's a relief..."
msgstr "Es un alivio..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "200_Zhao"
msgid "Ma-chan, they left with this message:"
msgstr "Cuando se fueron dejaron este mensaje:"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212_Mei Hua"
msgid "\"If you want your money back, tell the Parasite of Kamurocho to come alone to the vacant lot across from Public Park 3.\""
msgstr "\"Si quieres tu dinero de vuelta, dile al Parásito de Kamurocho que\\r\nvenga al solar vacío frente al Parque público 3\"."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Tanimura"
msgid "\"Parasite of Kamurocho,\" huh? Even criminals are calling me that now. What an honor."
msgstr "\"El Parásito de Kamurocho\", ¿eh? Incluso los criminales me llaman así ahora."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Tanimura"
msgid "Well, it looks like it's me they're after."
msgstr "Parece que vienen tras de mí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "248_Zhao"
msgid "Ma-chan, we can save that money back up again.\\r\nYou don't have to－"
msgstr "Ma-chan, podemos ahorrar el dinero de nuevo.\\r\nNo tienes que-"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "260_Tanimura"
msgid "I do. They're after me, so if I don't go, this will happen over and over."
msgstr "Yo iré. Vinieron por mí, si no voy, volverá a ocurrir."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "272_Mei Hua"
msgid "But Ma-chan! It's too dangerous!"
msgstr "¡Pero Ma-chan! ¡Es muy peligroso!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "284_Tanimura"
msgid "Ah, I'll be fine. This sorta thing is nothing new to me.\\r\nBut the vacant lot across from Public Park 3... That's far.\\r\nGuess I'd better start walking."
msgstr "Estaré bien. Estas cosas ya son costumbre.\\r\nPero el solar vacío frente al Parque público 3... Es lejos.\\r\nSupongo que ya debería ir saliendo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "296_Mei Hua"
msgid "Don't hurt yourself, Ma-chan..."
msgstr "No te lastimes Ma-chan..."

